meta {
  name: 21-account-lifecycle
  seq: 21
}

docs {
  Account changes that replace secrets or end sessions: master password, avatar,
  public key lookup, security stamp, user key rotation, SSO unlink, account
  deletion. The folder works on an account of its own, so nothing it changes
  reaches the other folders.

  A test named "NodeWarden has a route for it" marks an endpoint whose exact
  answer is not decided yet; it only records whether a route exists.
}
